ction><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2BKjjW4zLN7wNGlib16ATeD0dTn99qc5AbqHmTiaP0TiaJwV2jtohic69M4g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>中国科学院遗传与发育生物学研究所农业资源研究中心（以下简称“中心”）是中国科学院大学研究生培养单位之一，拥有生态学博士后流动站，生态学与遗传学博士学位培养点，以及生物与医药、资源利用与植物保护专业硕士学位培养点。根据中国科学院和教育部“科教协同育人计划”要求，为促进中国科学院与全国高校的交流与合作，让优秀大学生走进中国科学院大学，了解农业资源研究中心，培养科研兴趣和学术素养，中心拟于2025年7月14日-18日举办“未来之星”大学生夏令营活动，特邀有志继续深造的优秀大学生参加。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2B9V0gmw4xN4voSUboTbvFpVKricWCX6hq8ZQ3WFD293QiaKiavMvhibE6LA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2BIgV2iaYZwzD9bic33wVn0JfSXEic3JZEAFdPFVrKxlnibKMLfjk9nb7xtg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.活动时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>2025年7月14日-18日</span></p><p><span>如有变化，另行通知</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.组织形式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>线下60人，线上无人数限制</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.活动内容</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>（1）开营仪式、招生宣讲及考研指导；</span></p><p><span>（2）学术报告；</span></p><p><span>（3）科研实践；</span></p><p><span>（4）参观红色革命教育基地；</span></p><p><span>（5）面试；</span></p><p><span>（6）闭营仪式、颁发结业证书。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2B9V0gmw4xN4voSUboTbvFpVKricWCX6hq8ZQ3WFD293QiaKiavMvhibE6LA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2BIgV2iaYZwzD9bic33wVn0JfSXEic3JZEAFdPFVrKxlnibKMLfjk9nb7xtg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请</span><span><span>及</span></span><span>选拔</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2BolHU1Ro5h80rq5155VdEgB53FdjGVDnfQBqt6ZNLdqIBCThJiacZMtA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2BycNzkN1rQm7S1vRPficy1oACfP1ZdVyzGvoV5s6hPXMhiahq7ezmqOQA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>（1）专业：生态学、生物学、资源环境、水文学、环境科学、遥感科学、农学、遗传学、微生物学、 分子生物学、土壤学、植物学、地球科学、地理信息、地理学、栽培与耕作、设施农业等相关专业。</span></p><p><span>（2）学校及年级：本科一批次高校三年级在校生。</span></p><p><span>（3）成绩：排名在年级30%以内且英语达到国家四/六级水平425分以上，对有出色的科研成果者学习成绩标准可适当放宽。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2BycNzkN1rQm7S1vRPficy1oACfP1ZdVyzGvoV5s6hPXMhiahq7ezmqOQA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>2.系统报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>即日起至2025年6月30日</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2BycNzkN1rQm7S1vRPficy1oACfP1ZdVyzGvoV5s6hPXMhiahq7ezmqOQA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>3.申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>即日起，申请人登录中国科学院大学科教结合协同育人行动计划网页（http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/），选择“大学生夏令营报名”栏目（点击阅读原文，进行报名），注册后进入申请系统，查找“未来之星大学生夏令营”，点击“我要报名”，按要求如实填写系统中的各项信息后提交并下载。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2BycNzkN1rQm7S1vRPficy1oACfP1ZdVyzGvoV5s6hPXMhiahq7ezmqOQA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>4.申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>（1）2025年夏令营申请表（申请系统在线打印）；</span></p><p><span>（2）本科现阶段成绩单及专业排名证明原件（需有教务部门盖红章）；</span></p><p><span>（3）身份证、学生证、英语四/六级成绩单等体现自身英语水平的证明材料、获奖证书、发表论文或出版物复印件</span></p><p><span>（4）专家推荐信2封（自愿提交）</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>上述所有书面材料无需邮寄，报到时现场提交。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2BycNzkN1rQm7S1vRPficy1oACfP1ZdVyzGvoV5s6hPXMhiahq7ezmqOQA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>5.选拔程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>中心根据报名学生基本条件进行筛选并确定正式入选名单，入选学生将通过短信或电话通知。入选者请登录申报系统确认，没有网上确认的学生视为放弃参加本次夏令营活动。申请阶段无需提供纸质材料，正式录取为夏令营营员后需提交纸质材料。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2B9V0gmw4xN4voSUboTbvFpVKricWCX6hq8ZQ3WFD293QiaKiavMvhibE6LA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2BIgV2iaYZwzD9bic33wVn0JfSXEic3JZEAFdPFVrKxlnibKMLfjk9nb7xtg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>其他事项</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2BibyDo9IVWSgsDSLeZ3GSPbUry8xWPibOpkD2iaoQu9icYhgibZXvoMTcxPw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1.夏令营期间食宿全免，并报销单程火车票（家庭或学校所在地至石家庄的硬座/硬卧车票），被录取的学生2026年9月来中心报到时报销返程车票。</span></p><p><span>2.夏令营活动期间学生安全由本人及所在学校负责，我中心将为学生购买在营期间的人身意外伤害保险，报到时需签署安全协议，所有营员必须严格按照夏令营统一安排进行学习和活动。</span></p><p><span>3.实践合格者将颁发 “未来之星”大学生夏令营结业证书。</span></p><p><span>4.夏令营期间将组织2026年研究生面试，营员可报名参加。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2B9V0gmw4xN4voSUboTbvFpVKricWCX6hq8ZQ3WFD293QiaKiavMvhibE6LA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2BIgV2iaYZwzD9bic33wVn0JfSXEic3JZEAFdPFVrKxlnibKMLfjk9nb7xtg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>联系方式</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2Bffe3Uk3dhN99Y2WCia6EzpMCUyoJGhFWhoq95DhOnoj9qGQ4MEcr2Eg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1.营员咨询QQ群：1041860983</span></p><p><span>2.联系人：张老师、王老师</span></p><p><span>3.联系电话：0311-85801050</span></p><p><span>4.通讯地址：石家庄市裕华区槐中路286号，050021</span></p><p><span>5.电子邮箱：yzb@sjziam.ac.cn</span></p><p><span>6.中心网址：</span><span><span>http://www.sjziam.cas.cn</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2B9V0gmw4xN4voSUboTbvFpVKricWCX6hq8ZQ3WFD293QiaKiavMvhibE6LA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2BIgV2iaYZwzD9bic33wVn0JfSXEic3JZEAFdPFVrKxlnibKMLfjk9nb7xtg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>考生关心的问题</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>中心的师资力量如何？</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>中心拥有一支结构合理、经验丰富、学术造诣深的导师队伍。目前有中国科学院院士1人，中国科学院引才计划入选者10名，国家级人才计划入选者2名。博士生导师23人，硕士生导师29人。（导师信息可查看：http://www.sjziam.cas.cn/rcdw/yszj/）</span></p><p><span>招生专业：生态学、遗传学、资源利用与植物保护</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>中心有哪些培养平台？</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>中心下设水资源与节水农业研究室、生态与环境研究室、植物遗传与育种研究室3个固定建制研究室和1个柔性建制的区域农业与政策研究室，共4个研究室，5个科研大团队。</span></p><p><span>中心拥有5个野外试验台站和5个省部级重点实验室，为研究生培养提供了极具特色的科研与实践平台。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>中心研究生待遇如何？</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>中心研究生在学期间享有优厚的奖助学金，可保证研究生安心学业，无后顾之忧。三项奖助学金覆盖100%的非定向生：国家助学金、国科大学业奖金、中心的“助研/助教/助管”岗位津贴，其中硕士研究生最低标准为3.3万元/人·年，博士研究生最低标准为7万元/人·年。</span></p><p><span>另外，优秀学生还可获得各层面的奖学金，如：国家奖学金、中国科学院各类奖学金（如院长奖学金、朱李月华奖学金、地奥奖学金、优秀博士论文奖等）、研究所奖学金（如益海嘉里优秀博士生奖，振声奖学金等）、中心奖学金（如昌明奖学金）以及科研奖励等。</span></p><p><span>非定向生学费收取标准为：博士生1万元/年，硕士生0.8万元/年。</span></p><p><span>研究生公寓宽敞明亮(两人/间)，具有空调、独立卫生间和淋浴设施，住宿费为200元/月。学生食堂由单位补贴，伙食可口且价位低，深受同学们好评。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>中心研究生毕业就业情况如何？</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>中心研究生毕业后多数赴政府机关、国内外大学、科研院所等企事业单位就职、继续深造或从事博士后研究工作，平均就业率为100%（2020-2024年数据统计）。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/n37Bq4v0nicXIich2k1kiawUX5JBYBHjT2BIgV2iaYZwzD9bic33wVn0JfSXEic3JZEAFdPFVrKxlnibKMLfjk9nb7xtg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><s